 @AVerySillySausage  Talk about wild claims... 2 years from now is the 50-series... a "mid-range" 50-series would be a 5060 or 5070... at-best, a 5070 might come close to 4090 performance (at best), and it wouldn't be surprising if a 5070 was slower than a 4090.

